# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
# NOTE: `dist` is intentionally NOT ignored here.
#
# The server crate embeds `web/dist` at compile time via rust-embed, and the
# build script panics when it is missing. Committing the prebuilt bundle means
# the Rust workspace can be built with no Node/npm/bun toolchain present.
# Regenerate it with `npm install && npm run build` (or bun) in this directory.
dist-ssr
*.local

